<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Crossbow</h1>
<p>Average Length: 3.5 to 4 feet.
Type of Weapon: Missile Weapon.
Commonly used by: Crossbowmen.
</p><p>These weapons were often used on castle walls, as they had tremendous range and power. They were slower to reload than longbows, and therefore were not often used in army-to-army combat, but they were fantastic in defending against sieges.
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="In_Valhalla">In Valhalla</span></h2>
<p>In Valhalla the crossbow is a weapon skill of its own, one of the special weapons (see <a cmd='#'>Help Weapons</a>): it pierces, it leans on dexterity, with some strength, and it is slow to shoot. You shoot bolts with it (see <a cmd='#'>Help Shoot</a>). It is taught by the rangers from guild level 20.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
